  "prediction": "The meeting was about designing a new remote control for a television. The Project Manager introduced the meeting and explained the agenda, which included presentations from the Industrial Designer, User Interface Designer, and Marketing expert. The Industrial Designer presented his design for the remote control, explaining its technical function and the working of the remote control. He also discussed the design requirements, including the use of a single battery, a long-lasting battery, and a menu button. The User Interface Designer presented his ideas on the technical function design, discussing the options of a basic remote control or a multifunctional one. The Marketing expert presented the results of a usability lab-test, which showed that users dislike the look and feel of current remote controls and find them hard to use. The group discussed the market requirements, including the need to aim at a younger age group and to make the remote control easy to use. They also discussed the product requirements, including the need for a power button, channel selection, volume control, and a menu button. The group decided to include a L_C_D_ screen on the remote control and to keep the number of buttons to a minimum. They also decided to have a menu button and to use the same buttons to scroll through the menu and change options. The meeting concluded with the Project Manager announcing a lunch break and the next phase of the project, which would involve conceptual design.",
